Sort the intervals based on starting time.
Initialize:
start1 = start of first interval
end1 = end of first interval
Traverse remaining intervals:
If current interval overlaps (start2 <= end1):
Merge → update end1 = max(end1, end2)
Else:
Add previous interval to result
Update start1, end1 to current interval
Add the last interval to result.

Complexity:
TC=O(n log n)
SC=O(n)
